## Bench (preregistered here; NOT EXECUTED)
Weigh each article (+-0.1%) and take its envelope volume (+-0.5%); the
seat and the pulse audit are computed from the MEASURED (M, rho) only,
by the chip, with design windows hidden until the audit is written.
PASS: measured seat inside the article's design window and pulse class
as specified. KILL: any article measured outside its window - that
article's fate claim dies; re-tuning is a new revision. Strength,
weathering and code compliance are NOT claimed by this design and are
NOT MEASURED here - the design claims seats and fates only.

